          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "অবিলম্বে (ôbilômbe) is Sanskrit a- 'without' with vilamba, delay (Monier-Williams), and the Bengali ending -এ: 'without delay'. It is the word of notices and orders."
            }
          ]
        },
