              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "স্থগিত করা — sthôgitô kôrā — \"to postpone; to suspend\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "আবহাওয়া খারাপ হলে স্কুল খেলাটা স্থগিত করবে। ābôhāoyā khārāp hôle skul khelāṭā sthôgitô kôrbe. If the weather turns bad, the school will postpone the match."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (he/she …): তিনি সভাটা স্থগিত করলেন, tini sôbhāṭā sthôgitô kôrlen."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "স্থগিত করা (sthôgitô kôrā) is Sanskrit sthagita, covered or hidden (Monier-Williams), with করা. Monier-Williams also gives closed and stopped or interrupted, the sense Bengali keeps: to put a match, a meeting or a plan on hold."
            }
          ]
        },
